Package: gmIdSizing
Version: 0.2
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), libgl1, libxcb1, libfreetype6, libfontconfig1
Maintainer: Fengqi Zhang
Description: Gm/Id MOS Transistor Sizing GUI Tool
 A PyQt5-based GUI application for sizing MOS transistors
 using the Gm/Id methodology. Supports lookup table interpolation
 and optimization for analog IC design.
